From c56c29e01a4ba953e95b7b97870bfc2b2927a33d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 12:53:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/18] explorer: Bring The412Banner's XP desktop to GE-Proton
 11.0-5.

The XP taskbar, start menu and systray, the XP window frames in win32u,
the uxtheme and comctl32 tab changes, winexp.msstyles and the write.rc
fix, as carried by The412Banner's proton_11.0-2 (v7) Android stack and
their proton-cachyos 11 port (839f68d15 there). The Material 3 desktop
builds on it. The patch applies to this tree without conflicts, and the
explorer, uxtheme and comctl32 files come out identical to the
proton-cachyos 11 ones.

configure.ac only gains the winexp.msstyles makefile: DirectAudio is
already here.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019oF8nnfMD8z5Z1MeNXoYS9
